Import the library where the words are random
Import all the functions implemented in the last tasks


Create an unknown version of the word
using "_" for every letter

Set penalties to 0

WHILE penalties are less than 12:

    Display the unknown word '_'
    Display the number of penalties for each ittiration

    Ask the player for a letter or a complete word

    IF the player entered a letter:

        IF the letter is in the word:
            Reveal every occurrence of the letter
        ELSE:
            Add 1 penalty

    ELSE IF the player entered a complete word:

        IF the word is correct:
            The player wins
            STOP (exit)
        ELSE:
            Add 5 penalties

    IF the complete word has been revealed:
        The player wins
        STOP (exit)

IF penalties reach 12:
    The player loses

END